@startuml Vista de Processos – Level 3 (US 4.1.12 – Manage Incident Types)
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam sequence {
	ArrowColor Black
	ActorBorderColor #000000
	ActorBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	LifeLineBorderColor Black
	LifeLineBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantBorderColor Black
	ParticipantBackgroundColor #87CEEB
	ParticipantFontStyle bold
}

participant "«container (C4)»\nSPA (Web UI)" as UI #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIncidentTypesController" as IT_CTRL #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIncidentTypeService" as IT_SVC #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIncidentType" as IT_DOMAIN #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nIIncidentTypeRepository" as IT_REPO #87CEEB
participant "«component»\nOEMDbContext" as DB_CTX #87CEEB
participant "«external»\nIAM" as IAM #F5F5DC

-> UI: 1: request to manage Incident Types
activate UI
UI -> IAM: 1.1: validate token (Port Authority Officer role)
activate IAM
IAM --> UI: 1.1.1: token valid
deactivate IAM

UI -> IT_CTRL: 1.2: GET /api/incidenttypes
activate IT_CTRL
IT_CTRL -> IT_SVC: 1.2.1: GetAllAsync()
activate IT_SVC
IT_SVC -> IT_REPO: 1.2.1.1: GetAllAsync()
activate IT_REPO
IT_REPO --> IT_SVC: 1.2.1.2: list of IncidentTypes
deactivate IT_REPO
IT_SVC --> IT_CTRL: 1.2.2: List<IncidentTypeDTO>
deactivate IT_SVC
IT_CTRL --> UI: 1.3: 200 OK (hierarchical types)
deactivate IT_CTRL

UI --> : 1.4: display tree view
deactivate UI

-> UI: 2: create new incident type
activate UI
UI -> IT_CTRL: 2.1: POST /api/incidenttypes (CreateIncidentTypeDTO)
activate IT_CTRL
IT_CTRL -> IT_SVC: 2.1.1: CreateAsync(dto)
activate IT_SVC

IT_SVC -> IT_SVC: 2.1.1.1: ValidateCodeUnique(code)
IT_SVC -> IT_SVC: 2.1.1.2: ValidateParentExists(parentCode)

IT_SVC -> IT_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3: new IncidentType(code, name, severity, parentCode)
activate IT_DOMAIN
IT_DOMAIN -> IT_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3.1: ValidateCode() [T-INC###]
IT_DOMAIN -> IT_DOMAIN: 2.1.1.3.2: SetSeverity(Minor|Major|Critical)
IT_DOMAIN --> IT_SVC: 2.1.1.4: IncidentType entity
deactivate IT_DOMAIN

IT_SVC -> IT_REPO: 2.1.1.5: AddAsync(incidentType)
activate IT_REPO
IT_REPO -> DB_CTX: 2.1.1.5.1: Add(entity)
activate DB_CTX
DB_CTX --> IT_REPO: 2.1.1.5.2: saved
deactivate DB_CTX
IT_REPO --> IT_SVC: 2.1.1.6: persisted
deactivate IT_REPO

IT_SVC --> IT_CTRL: 2.1.2: IncidentTypeDTO
deactivate IT_SVC
IT_CTRL --> UI: 2.2: 201 Created
deactivate IT_CTRL

UI --> : 2.3: display confirmation, update tree
deactivate UI

@enduml
